        "readable_text": "Prompt:\nIf [MATH: f(x) = 3^{2x^{2}},] find [MATH: f^{\u2032}(x).]\n\nChoices:\na. [MATH: x3^{2x}\\ln (3)]\nb. [MATH: 2x3^{2x^{2}}]\nc. [MATH: 2 \u22c5 3^{2x}\\ln (3)]\nd. [MATH: 4x3^{2x^{2}}\\ln (3)]\ne. [MATH: 4x3^{2x^{2}}]"
